hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1133","Muhammad bin Yahya told us, Omar bin Hafs bin Ghayath told us, my father told us, Al-Amash told us, he said: I heard Abu Sufyan, saying: I heard Jabir, He says: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “There is no male or female but on his head a knot tied when he lies down. If he wakes up, he remembers God.” A knot is untied, so when he gets up and performs ablution and prays, the knots are untied.” Muhammad told us, Ubayd Allah told us, on the authority of Shayban, on the authority of Al-A’mash, on the authority of Abu Sufyan, on the authority of Jabir, the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “There is no male or female without a scar tied over him when he lies down at night,” with the same, and added, “and he became of a light and kind soul, and he attained good.” Abu Bakr said: Al-Jarir: the rope."
